{
  "case_id": "2022-21-984",
  "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0000-0001",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 2,
        "start": 2
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 11:45 a.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Paul D. Clement",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0000-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Respondent earned over $200,000 a year and concededly performed executive functions in supervising a dozen or more workers. He likewise was guaranteed at least $963 in any week in which he worked a minute. He is thus exempt from the overtime laws under the specialized streamlined exemption for highly compensated workers set forth in Section 601."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0000-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 6,
        "start": 6
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: Mr. Clement, the government says that its starting point is that -- whether or not the --this is -- you've established that you -- that the Respondent is -- or -- is salaried. And he argues that he does not receive his compensation on a salary basis."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0000-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 8,
        "start": 8
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE JACKSON: Counsel, I --I don't read the regulation that way. So can you -- can you help us to understand why you are saying that the amount is the only relevant marker of the applicability of 601?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0000-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 11,
        "start": 11
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAVANAUGH: Your -- your point is the two words \"or part\" in 602. If it said constituting all of the employee's compensation, then you would -- that would be different?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0001-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 23,
        "start": 23
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: If you tell a client, Mr. Clement, that he has to pay you on an hourly basis, are you -- is -- are you referring to your hourly billable rate, or are you saying that the client has to give you a check every hour?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0001-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 25,
        "start": 25
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE JACKSON: Mr. Clement, can I ask you about the relationship between 601 and the rest of the EAP exemption regulation? Your question presented suggests that it's \"standalone\" and you use that term."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Clement",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0002-0000",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 44,
        "start": 44
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. CLEMENT: Yeah, I -- I think there -- again, I don't know the details of it. I think there's a case that maybe attacks 604(b) just on that basis, but it's not quite the same issue here."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Sullivan",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0002-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 58,
        "start": 58
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. SULLIVAN: Mr. Chief Justice, and may it please the Court: For over 80 years, the FLSA has made two things clear: One, a bona fide executive must be paid on a salary basis, and, two, a pure daily rate employee is not paid on a salary basis."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0002-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 63,
        "start": 63
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAVANAUGH: Where do you get that?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0003-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 66,
        "start": 66
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAVANAUGH: Can I just ask a factual question? Was he guaranteed at least 963 a week?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0003-0004",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 83,
        "start": 83
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE THOMAS: No, just -- I'm only interested in the compensation features. Let's say the first year a person is salaried at $50,000 a year or basically $200,000, as we have in this case."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0004-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 90,
        "start": 90
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAVANAUGH: About that, let me ask about that."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Heritage Reporting Corporation",
      "case_id": "2022-21-984",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "dd8541ad60a210e575c056fb4731f2355fc62c980ce9e7324883fd996efc925d",
      "evidence_id": "ev-dd8541ad60a2-0004-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 106,
        "start": 106
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "(Whereupon, at 1:20 p.m., the case was submitted.)"
    },
